*** BEGIN PATCH SPEC ***
This patch is intentionally expressed as a port checklist rather than a
blind line-number patch. In the GLib 2.72.4 Meson build, set the following
features for BlockOS:

  -Dtests=false
  -Dinstalled_tests=false
  -Dgtk_doc=false
  -Dman-pages=false
  -Dsysprof=disabled
  -Dlibmount=disabled
  -Dselinux=disabled
  -Dsystemtap=false

Avoid enabling Linux-specific backends (inotify/eventfd/epoll/timerfd,
procfs/sysinfo, memfd, Linux seccomp) until the corresponding BlockOS ABI is
present. Do not replace POSIX APIs with Linux syscall names: use the BlockOS
libc wrappers already supplied by the project.
*** END PATCH SPEC ***
